	<!-- Testimonial Start -->
	<div id="rs-testimonial-2" class="rs-testimonial bg5 sec-spacer">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="sec-title mb-50">
				<h2 class="white-color">Testimonials</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-md-12">
					<div  class="rs-carousel owl-carousel" data-loop="true" data-items="2" data-margin="30" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-timeout="5000" data-smart-speed="1200" data-dots="false" data-nav="true" data-nav-speed="false" data-mobile-device="1" data-mobile-device-nav="true" data-mobile-device-dots="false" data-ipad-device="2" data-ipad-device-nav="true" data-ipad-device-dots="false" data-md-device="2" data-md-device-nav="true" data-md-device-dots="false">
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img" >
								<img src="images/testimonial/mayur.webp" alt="Mayur Patil">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Mayur Patil</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;" class="overflow-testimonial">
									It was my immense luck and fortune to be a part of PICT where I can grow. The entire faculty and department leave no stone unturned to shape one's future. It's their efforts that make me count myself into better professionals. I am also grateful to TNP Cell for organizing placements in this pandemic and helping students to get placed in dream companies. Overall it was a great experience and lifetime memory at PICT.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/medhavi.webp" alt="Medhavi Pande">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Medhavi Pande</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									PICT believes in bringing the best out of each student. The faculty has always been very supportive. Apart from the academics and placements being above expectations, the college has always encouraged students to participate in extra-co curricular activities. 
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/Sourav_Patil.webp" alt="Sourav_Patil">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Sourav Patil</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									PICT has been a great contributor to the development of my personality. I have established my leadership, time management and team skills and have also been able to advance these skills to the whole new augment level. With an attitude of being ever ready to help, and not only delivering classroom teachings, but they are also the pillars of the learning gained from this esteemed college and this is a treasure for life.
									It was wonderful experience of learning with prolific exposure to outside. Huge respect, love and devotion for entire faculty members and department. It's their efforts that make me to count myself into better professionals.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/shardul.webp" alt="Shardul Khandekar">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Shardul Khandekar</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									At PICT, knowledge is not a restricted term. Students have the freedom to explore different domains of their choice. Students get the opportunity to work on real-time industrial projects under the guidance of highly qualified and experienced professors. 
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/shreya.webp" alt="Shreya Rodge">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Shreya Rodge</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									I am pursuing my final year B.E. in Electronics and Telecommunications Engineering. The quality of teaching is very good and understandable. The curriculum is updated and includes recent developments in the field of the student and motivates them to achieve their goal to success. The campus provides students with a comprehensive list of features and facilities to cater to the students' learning needs and comfort. In addition to this, the college has an excellent Training and Placement Cell that provides the students with ample opportunities.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/minal.webp" alt="Minal Kokade">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Minal Kokade</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									PICT is one of the top most Engineering colleges in Pune. All the courses conducted by college were great. Teachers and lab assistants have good knowledge of the subjects. Apart from curricular many extra curricular activities are also held by college for overall growth of the students. I enjoyed the learning process and grateful for getting admission here. 
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/varad.webp" alt="Varad Joshi">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Varad Joshi</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									It was a great pleasure to have spent 4 years of my college life in PICT. The entire faculty and department is there to support you in every walk of your professional life. It was very good opportunity to learn and excel. I am also grateful to Training and Placement Cell to provide students ample opportunities. It was wonderful experience of learning with prolific exposure to outside.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/sahil.webp" alt="Sahil Naphadea">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Sahil Naphadea</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									The 4 years in college were absolutely amazing. Working for several communities, partaking in the college events, both technical and cultural; are some of the fondest memories of mine. 
									The support from teachers and staff, timely help regarding anything as well as a streamlined processing, made the experience even better. Last but not the least, the friendships that were made in these four years, will always be cherished.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/hrishikesh.webp" alt="Hrishikesh Dange">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Hrishikesh Dange</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									Being a reputed college in the city, PICT attracts lots of opportunities which  opens door for various domains for students. The atmosphere is technically enriching ,which sustains the competitive spirit of the college which indeed maintains it's reputation.
									Despite being a computer oriented college, it has great command over social,cultural and artistic  domain along with proficiency in robotics domain as well. Its certainly a college worthy of giving you a great career boost.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="testimonial-item">
							<div class="testi-img">
								<img src="images/testimonial/piyush.webp" alt="Piyush Gulhane">
							</div>
							<div class="testi-desc">
								<h4 class="testi-name">Piyush Gulhane</h4>
								<p style="text-align: justify;"  class="overflow-testimonial">
									At PICT , it was my great pleasure to have spent 4 years of my college life. In these years I had a great experience in every field be it studies, sports, social service and many more. Every professor played an important role in shaping my career. Whatever I am today after engineering is the output of efforts put together by all teachers, staff and their valuable guidance.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
